          "caption": {
            "text": "Are you ready for the total solar eclipse?\n\nOn Wednesday, Aug. 12, the Moon will pass in front of the Sun, creating a total solar eclipse for viewers in Greenland, Iceland, and Spain. Much of Canada, Europe, and parts of the United States from Alaska to North Carolina will see a partial eclipse.\n\nIf you're not in the zone of totality for this eclipse, no worries — we'll be streaming it all online, including here on Instagram! Visit our website for more info and check out our link-in-bio to learn more about eclipses.\n\nCredit: NASA\n\n#NASA #Eclipse #Eclipse2026",
